2 CONT '''Ferdinando I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana was born on 30 July 1549.3 He was the son''' of Cosimo I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Eleanora de Toledo. '''He married Christine de Lorraine''', daughter of Charles III, Duc de
2 CONC  Lorraine and Claude de Valois, Princesse de France, '''on 3 May 1589.2 He died on 17 February 1609 at age 59'''.2
2 CONT '''     He succeeded as the Granduca di Toscana in 1587'''.4
2 CONT '''Children of Ferdinando I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Christine de Lorraine'''
