2 CONT '''Cosimo II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana was born in 1590.1 He was the son''' of Ferdinando I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Christine de Lorraine. '''He married Maria Magdalena Erzherzogin von Österreich''', daughter of Ka
2 CONC rl II Erzherzog von Österreich and Maria Prinzessin von Bayern, '''in 1608.1 He died in 1621'''.1
2 CONT '''     He succeeded as the Granduca di Toscana in 1609'''.1
2 CONT '''Children of Cosimo II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Maria Magdalena Erzherzogin von Österreich'''
