2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans was born on 25 April 1608 at Fontainebleau, Île-de-France, France.1 He was the son of Henri IV, Roi de France and Marie de Medici.1 He married, firstly, Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier
2 CONC , daughter of Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier and Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse, on 6 August 1626 at Nantes, Bretagne, France.1 He married, secondly, Marguerite de Lorraine, daughter of François II, Duc de Lorraine and Chris
2 CONC tine Gräfin von Salm, on 31 January 1632 at Nancy, France.1,3 He died on 2 February 1660 at age 51 at Blois, Berri, France.1
2 CONT
