2 CONT
2 CONT         Onorato Malabayla, Count of Canale, no issue;
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Prince Victor Amadeus of Savoy, (1 March 1690 – 4 April 1741) Prince of Carignan married:
2 CONT
2 CONT         Maria Vittoria Francesca of Savoy[5]had issue;
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Prince Thomas Philippe Geatano of Savoy (10 May 1696 – 12 Sep 1715) never married.
