2 CONC  Chartres, son of PHILIPPE de France Duc d’Orléans & his second wife Elisabeth Charlotte Pfalzgräfin am Rhein (Château de Saint-Cloud 2 Aug 1674-Versailles 2 Dec 1723).  He succeeded his father in 1701 as Duc d’Orléans.  Regent of
