2 CONT
2 CONT      Louis César de Bourbon, Comte de Vexin was born illegitimately on 20 June 1672 at Genitoy, Lagny, France. (1) He was the son of Louis XIV, Roi de France and Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 10 January 1683 at age 10 at Paris, France. (1)
2 CONT
