2 CONT Catherine Laura	10 January 1675	3 October 1675	died of convulsions.[116]
2 CONT Unnamed child	October 1675	stillbirth[116]
2 CONT Isabel (or Isabella)	28 August 1676	2 or 4 March 1681	buried in Westminster Abbey on 4 March (Old Style) as "The Lady Isabella, daughter to the Duke of York"[117]
2 CONT Charles, Duke of Cambridge	7 November 1677	12 December 1677	died of smallpox[116]
2 CONT Elizabeth	c. 1678	 
2 CONT Unnamed child	February 1681	stillbirth[116]
2 CONT Charlotte Maria	16 August 1682	16 October 1682	died of convulsions[116] and buried in Westminster Abbey on 8 October (Old Style) as "The Lady Charlotte-Marie, daughter to the Duke of York"[118]
2 CONT Unnamed child	October 1683	stillbirth[116]
2 CONT Unnamed child	May 1684	stillbirth[119]
2 CONT James, Prince of Wales "the Old Pretender"	10 June 1688	1 January 1766	married 1719, Clementina Sobieska; had issue
2 CONT Louisa Maria Teresa	28 June 1692	18 April 1712	died of smallpox[12
