2 CONT
2 CONT     * Prince Louis Victor of Savoy, Prince of Carignan (Paris, 25 September, 1721 - Turin, 16 December, 1778)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Prince Victor Amadeus of Savoy (1722)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * A stillborn daughter (1729)
2 CONT
