1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Lady Mary Tudor''' was born on October 16, 1673, in Westminster, London, Middlesex, England. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-3562818 Charles II of England] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-25168787 Moll Davis]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38503929 Edward Radclyffe, Second Earl of Derwentwater] on August 18, 1687. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-38503927 James Radclyffe, 3rd Earl of Derwentwater];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-84597294 Honourable Francis Radclyffe];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-38503932 Charles Radclyffe, &quot;5th Earl of Derwentwater&quot;];
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-84597319 Lady Mary Tudor Radclyffe]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-65295113 Henry Graham, of Levens]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38503931 James Rooke, Major] in 1707. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34691746755 Margaret Frances Disney Rooke]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 5, 1726, in Paris, Ile-De-France, France. 
2 CONT ----
