2 CONT
2 CONT Philip of Spain, Duke of Parma, Piacenza and Guastalla (15 March 1720 – 18 July 1765) was duke of Parma from 1748 to 1765. He founded the House of Bourbon-Parma (a.k.a the Bourbons of Parma), a cadet line of the Spanish branch of 
2 CONC the dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
2 CONT [show]
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 1 Life
2 CONT
2 CONT           o 1.1 Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 2 Ancestors
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 3 Titles and Styles
