1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Sir Francis Scott Memorial .
2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 11, 1695 Death: 	Apr. 22, 1751, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Scott, 2nd Duke of Buccleuchson of James Scott, Earl of Dalkeith and Lady Henrietta Hyde.  He was baptised on 20 January 1694/95 at St. James' Church, Westminster, London, England. He married, firstly, Lady Jane Douglas, d
2 CONC aughter of James Douglas, 2nd Duke of Queensberry and Mary Boyle, on 5 April 1720 at Earl of Rochester's House, Privy Gardens, Whitehall, London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Alice Powell, daughter of Joseph Powell, on 4 September 1744 at St. George's Chapel, Mayfair, London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died aged 56. He was buried at Chapel, Eton College, Eton, Berkshire, England, 'very meanly.
2 CONT
