2 CONT
2 CONT Louis-Ferdinand
2 CONT
2 CONT Dauphin of Viennois
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis-Ferdinand, Dauphin of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Infanta Maria Teresa of Spain
2 CONT
2 CONT Duchess Marie-Josèphe of Saxony
2 CONT
