2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Joséphine of Savoy (Maria Giuseppina Luigia; 2 September 1753 – England, 13 November 1810) was the wife of the future King Louis XVIII of France. She was a princess of Sardinia and of Piedmont by birth.
2 CONT
