2 CONT
2 CONT      Louis François de Conti, Prince de Conti was born on 1 September 1734 at Paris, France. He was the son of Louis François I de Bourbon, Prince de Conti and Louise Diane d'Orléans. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Fortunata Maria d'Este, daughter of Francesco III d'Este, Duca di Modena and Charlotte Aglaé d'Orléans, on 27 February 1759. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 March 1814 at age 79 at Barcelona, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Louis François de Conti, Prince de Conti gained the title of Prince Louis François de Conti.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Louis François de Conti, Prince de Conti
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Louis François de Conti b. 1761, d. 3 Aug 1785
