2 CONT Carolina Maria di Borbone, Principessa di Parma was born on 22 November 1770 at Parma, Italy. She was the daughter of Ferdinando I di Borbone, Duca di Parma and Marie Amalie Erzherzogin von Österreich. (1) She married Maximilian P
2 CONC rinz von Sachsen, son of Friedrich Christian Leopold Kurfürst von Sachsen and Maria Antonia Prinzessin von Bayern, on 9 May 1792. 
