2 CONT Jesse Welton ( d. ca. 1829?)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jesse was probably born in Virginia. He was named as an heir in his father's will (1764). Jess was included among Judy's "Heroes in the Revolution." In 1779 he was granted a small acreage on the South Branch Potomac from the Fairf
2 CONC ax estate. 26 He was a taxpayer in Hampshire County in the early 1780's and in Hardy after its partition from Hampshire. The inventory of Jesse Welton's estate, recorded in Hardy County in 1829, provided the dte of death above. 27
2 CONT
