1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Roper''' was born on 7 January 1768 the son of Rev. Hon. Richard Henry Roper and Mary Tenison. He married Elizabeth Fish, daughter of R Fish. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a Barrister and lived at Rathfarnham Castle, County Dublin, Ireland. He died on 16 July 1832 at age 64.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Roper and Elizabeth Fish
2 CONT * Charles Roper d. 9 May 1861
2 CONT * Jane Anne Roper d. 9 Feb 1849
2 CONT * Eliza Roper d. 18 Feb 1881
2 CONT * Isabella Roper d. 5 Apr 1876
2 CONT * Sir Henry Roper b. 16 Apr 1800, d. 20 Mar 1863
2 CONT
