1 NOTE He was born out of wedlock.
1 NOTE In 1745 he became a member of the Council.
1 NOTE Info from Greg NELSON, Salem, OR.
1 NOTE In 1744 he was appointed Collector of Customs at Patuxent, MD.
1 NOTE The illegitimate son of Willliam Calvert 5th Lord of Baltimore
2 CONT
2 CONT "Stories vary as to who his mother may have been, with the most likely possibility being the Countess of Walsingham, Melusina de Schulenberg, an illegitimate daughter of King George I and Ermengarde Melusina de Schulenberg, duches
2 CONC s of Kendal."
2 CONT
