2 CONT      Lady Sophia Sarah Mary FitzGerald was the daughter of Lt.-Gen. James FitzGerald, 1st Duke of Leinster and Lady Emilia Mary Lennox.1 She died on 21 March 1845, unmarried.1
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
