2 CONT *Xavier Marie Joseph de France, duc d'Aquitaine was the third surviving child and eldest son of Dauphin Louis Ferdinand of France and Princess Maria Josepha of Saxony. He was a brother to the future kings Louis XVI, Louis XVIII an
