1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carlota_Joaquina_of_Spain
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00000822&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #689, b. 25 April 1775, d. 7 January 1830
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=11 Mar 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=9.78%
2 CONT
2 CONT  Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España was born on 25 April 1775 at Aranjuez, Madrid, Spain. (2) She was the daughter of Carlos IV, Rey de España and Maria Luisa di Borbone, Principessa di Parma. She married Dom João VI de
2 CONC  Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil, son of Dom Pedro III de Bragança, Rei de Portugal and Dona Maria I de Bragança, Rainha de Portugal, on 9 June 1785 at Lisbon, Portugal. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 7 January 1830 at age 54 at Queluz. (2) She was buried at São Vicente de Fora, Lisbon, Portugal. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España was a member of the House of Bourbon. She was baptised with the name of Carlota Joaquina Teresa Cayetana. (2) She gained the title of Infanta de España.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España and Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Maria Teresa de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal+3 b. 29 Apr 1793, d. 17 Jan 1874
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Maria Isabel de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal+3 b. 19 May 1797, d. 26 Dec 1818
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Dom Pedro IV de Bragança, Rei de Portugal+4 b. 12 Oct 1798, d. 24 Sep 1834
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Maria Francesca de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal+3 b. 22 Apr 1800, d. 4 Sep 1834
2 CONT
2 CONT -5. Isabella de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal4 b. 1801, d. 1876
2 CONT
2 CONT -6. Miguel I de Bragança, Rei de Portugal+ b. 26 Oct 1802, d. 14 Nov 1866
2 CONT
2 CONT -7. Anne de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal4 b. 1806, d. 1857
