1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Golden Fleece - Knights: Spanish Branch===
2 CONT * [http://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carlos_de_Bourbon wikipedia......]
2 CONT * Carlos Maria de Borbón, Duques de Molina
2 CONT * M, #105766, b. 29 March 1788, d. 10 March 1855
2 CONT * Carlos Maria de Borbón, Duques de Molina was born on 29 March 1788. He was the son of Carlos IV, Rey de España and Maria Luisa di Borbone, Principessa di Parma. He married, firstly, Maria Francesca de Bragança, Infanta de Portug
2 CONC al, daughter of Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil and Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España, on 22 September 1816 at Madrid, Spain. He married, secondly, Maria Teresa de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal, daugh
2 CONC ter of Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil and Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España, on 20 October 1838 at Azcoitia. 
2 CONT * He died on 10 March 1855 at age 66 at Trieste, Italy.
2 CONT * Carlos Maria de Borbón, Duques de Molina was a member of the House of Bourbon. He gained the title of Duques de Molina. He gained the title of Infante de España.
2 CONT * Children of Carlos Maria de Borbón, Duques de Molina and Maria Francesca de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal
2 CONT
