1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00001475&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT * João Maria José Francisco Xavier de Paula Luís António Domingos Rafael de Bragança
2 CONT * King(Rei) de Portugal
2 CONT * Wikipedia:
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_VI_of_Portugal English....],  [http://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jo%C3%A3o_VI_de_Portugal Português....]
2 CONT * Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil
2 CONT * M, #105860, b. 13 May 1767, d. 10 March 1826
2 CONT * Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil was born on 13 May 1767 at Lisbon, Portugal. (4) He was the son of Dom Pedro III de Bragança, Rei de Portugal and Dona Maria I de Bragança, Rainha de Portugal. (3) He married Car
2 CONC lota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España, daughter of Carlos IV, Rey de España and Maria Luisa di Borbone, Principessa di Parma, on 9 June 1785 at Lisbon, Portugal. (4) 
2 CONT * He died on 10 March 1826 at age 58 at Lisbon, Portugal. He was buried at São Vicente de Fora, Lisbon, Portugal. (4)
2 CONT *  Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil was baptised with the name of João Maria José Francisco Xavier de Paula Luis António Domingos Rafael.4 He gained the title of Principe João de Brasil between 1788 and 1816.4 He 
2 CONC held the office of Regent of Portugal on 10 February 1792. (4) He gained the title of Rei João IV de Brasil on 16 December 1815. (5), (4) He succeeded to the title of Rei João VI de Portugal in 1818. (5)
2 CONT * Children of Dom João VI de Bragança, Rei de Portugal e Brasil and Carlota Joaquina de Borbón, Infanta de España
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Maria Teresa de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal+ (3) b. 29 Apr 1793, d. 17 Jan 1874
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Maria Isabel de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal+3 b. 19 May 1797, d. 26 Dec 1818
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Dom Pedro IV de Bragança, Rei de Portugal+4 b. 12 Oct 1798, d. 24 Sep 1834
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Maria Francesca de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal+3 b. 22 Apr 1800, d. 4 Sep 1834
2 CONT
2 CONT -5. Isabella de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal4 b. 1801, d. 1876
2 CONT
2 CONT -6. Miguel I de Bragança, Rei de Portugal+ b. 26 Oct 1802, d. 14 Nov 1866
2 CONT
2 CONT -7. Anne de Bragança, Infanta de Portugal4 b. 1806, d. 1857
