2 CONT Prince Louis of Orléans (Louis Charles Philippe Raphaël d'Orléans; 25 October 1814 – 26 June 1896) was the second son of the future King Louis-Philippe I of France, and his wife Maria Amalia of Naples and Sicily. Under the reign o
2 CONC f his father from 1830–1848, he was styled as Prince Louis, Duke of Nemours.
