2 CONC t or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume XII/1, page 155. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT ##[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XII/1, page 157.
