1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rt. Hon. Sir George Hamilton Seymour1 M, #24610, b. 21 September 1797, d. 2 February 1880 Last Edited=13 Nov 2008 Consanguinity Index=0.0%
2 CONT      Rt. Hon. Sir George Hamilton Seymour was born on 21 September 1797.2 He was the son of Lord George Seymour and Isabella Hamilton.2 He married Hon. Gertrude Trevor, daughter of General Henry Otway Trevor, 21st Lord Dacre and P
2 CONC yne Crosbie, on 21 July 1831.2 He died on 2 February 1880 at age 82.2
2 CONT      He held the office of Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary to Austria.2 He was invested as a Knight Grand Cross, Hanoverian Order (G.C.H.).2 He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.).2 He was invested as a Knig
2 CONC ht Grand Cross, Order of the Bath (G.C.B.).2 Children of Rt. Hon. Sir George Hamilton Seymour and Hon. Gertrude Trevor Gertrude Frances Seymour+1 d. 2 Dec 1909 Isabella Seymour2 d. 18 Feb 1925 Augusta Emily Seymour+2 b. 6 Nov 1835
2 CONC , d. 25 Feb 1911 Arthur Henry Seymour2 b. 25 Aug 1838, d. 27 Sep 1910 Lt.-Col. Leopold Richard Seymour+2 b. 2 Jun 1841, d. 30 May 1904 Alfred Seymour+2 b. 16 Feb 1843, d. 30 Jan 1897 Sir George Evelyn Seymour+2 b. 15 Nov 1848, d. 
2 CONC 11 Aug 1884 Citations [S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 603. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37] [S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2461.htm#i24610
