2 CONT *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucius_Cary,_6th_Viscount_Falkland
2 CONT *  Madame de la Tour du Pin (1999). Memoirs, laughing and dancing our way to the precipice. Harvill. ISBN 978-1-86046-548-2.
2 CONT *Caroline Moorehead (2009). Dancing to the Precipice: The Life of Lucie de la Tour Du Pin, Eyewitness to an Era. HarperCollins. [https://archive.org/details/dancingtoprecipi00moor Archive.Org]
