1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sir Edward Mostyn, 7th Bt.''' (b 10.04.1785, d 18.07.1841) was born on 10 April 1785 the son of Sir Pyers Mostyn, 6th Bt. and Barbara Slaughter. He married, firstly, Frances Blundell, daughter of Nicholas Blunde
2 CONC ll and Clementina Tempest, on 20 October 1808. He married, secondly, Constantia Slaughter, daughter of Henry Slaughter and Mary Frances (?), on 2 August 1826. He died on 18 July 1841 at age 56.
2 CONT
2 CONT * He gained the title of  7th Baronet Mostyn, of Talacre.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Edward Mostyn, 7th Bt. and Frances Blundell
2 CONT * Barbara Mostyn
2 CONT * Frances Mostyn d. 26 Mar 1859
2 CONT * Sir Pyers Mostyn, 8th Bt. b. 27 Sep 1811, d. 14 May 1882
2 CONT * Captain Edward Henry Mostyn b. 14 Jan 1813, d. 23 Feb 1895
2 CONT * Llewelyn Mostyn b. 22 Jun 1816, d. 1897
2 CONT * William Mostyn b. 2 Aug 1823, d. 1909
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sir Edward Mostyn, 7th Bt. and Constantia Slaughter
