2 CONT * Teresa Mostyn d. 17 Aug 1873
2 CONT * Mary Pauline Mostyn
2 CONT * Agnes Mostyn
2 CONT * Catherine Mostyn
2 CONT * Roger Joseph Mostyn b. 1840, d. 21 Jan 1911 Ref: [http://thepeerage.com/p7560.htm The Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Sir Edward Mostyn, 7th Bart of Talacre, Sheriff of Flintshire''' (b 10.04.1785, d 18.07.1841) had issue 
2 CONT * m1. (20.10.1808) Frances Blundell (d 25.01.1825, dau of Nicholas Blundell of Crosby) 
2 CONT * m2. (02.08.1826) Constantia Slaughter (d 12.12.1872, dau of Henry Slaughter of Furze Hall, cousin)  Ref: [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4fz/mostyn2.php#dau3 StirNet]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Further research for SISTER of Sir Edward Mostyn, Bart of Talacre (May be different Edward)
