2 CONT Charles Frederick 1802 1868 
2 CONT William Beans 1803 1836 
2 CONT Julianna 1819 1856
2 CONT Eleonara Adela 1821 1902 
2 CONT Benedict Calvert 1791 1817
2 CONT
