2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=44862103&ref=wvr
2 CONT
2 CONT Rev John C. Marcum
2 CONT *Birth: 	1798, USA
2 CONT *Death: 	Apr. 1, 1860, USA
2 CONT *Husband Of: Clarinda "Chloe"/"Cloe" (Stephenson/Copley) Marcum
2 CONT *Son Of: Josiah Marcum and Eda/Edy (McDonald) Marcum
2 CONT
2 CONT Per other researcher(s), the burial sites of Rev. John C. & Chloe Marcum are now beneath the benches in the covered meeting shelter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research indicates this Cemetery may also be known as the "Marcum-Williamson"/"Williamson-Marcum Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN of John C. & Clarinda [per other researcher(s)]:
