2 CONT Per other researcher(s), the burial sites of Rev. John C. & Chloe Marcum are now beneath the benches in the covered meeting shelter.
2 CONT --ADDENDUM -- Appears to have been an error as Chad Brown has posted on 4-24-2016 a photo of grave marker ..  Della 8-1-2016)
2 CONT
2 CONT Rev. John C. & Clarinda "Chloe"/"Cloe" (Stephenson/Copley) Marcum were my paternal Double GrX3 Grandparents .. Della 11-27-2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Research indicates this Cemetery may have occasionally been referred to as the "Marcum-Williamson"/"Williamson-Marcum Cemetery" but was known and IS KNOWN as Williamson Cemetery .. Della 11-27-2009
