2 CONC  office of Member of Parliament (M.P.) (Tory) for Chichester between 1812 and 1819.6 He gained the rank of Captain in 1813 in the service of the 52nd Foot.6 He fought in the Battle of Orthez in 1814, where he was wounded.6 He was 
