2 CONT # Alexander Ratliff
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret HINSON and William RATLIFF are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Stephen A. RATLIFF was born 28 Jun 1795 in Green Co. KY, and died 13 Jul 1859 in Barren Co. KY. He married Patsy A. BRADLEY 26 Aug 1819 in Barren Co. KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. James RATLIFF was born 19 Jan 1798 in Barren Co. KY, and died 16 Apr 1860 in Macon Co. MO. He married Martha "Patsy" HIND 18 Mar 1817 in Barren County KY, daughter of Samuel HIND and Margaret "Peggy" Willis Arnold. She was bor
2 CONC n 29 Jun 1799 in Near Horse Cave KY, and died 5 Jun 1880 in New Boston MO.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Mary RATLIFF was born 26 Dec 1800 in Barren Co. KY, and died 23 Feb 1864 in Randolph Co. MO. She married Richard BRADLEY 25 Feb 1818 in Barren Co. KY. He was born 27 Dec 1795 in Barren Co. KY, and died 25 Jul 1865 in Randolph
2 CONC  Co. MO.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. William RATLIFF was born in Barren Co. KY, and died 1860 . He married Mary "Polly" PHILPOT 27 Nov 1826 in Barren Co. Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Jonathan RATLIFF was born in BARREN CO. KY, and died 13 Nov 1881 in BENTON CO. ARK. He married Dulaney Crawford ROWLAND 15 Dec 1829 in Randolph Co. MO. She was born 16 Dec 1807 in TN, and died 5 Jul 1899 in Garfield, AR.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. *Jordan RATLIFF was born  in Barren Co. Kentucky, and died 1840 in Randolph County Missouri. He married Lavinia ROWLAND 20 Sep 1831 in Randolph County MO. She was born 1815 in TN, and died in Macon Co. MO.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. Alexander RATLIFF was born  in Barren Co. KY, and died ABT 1879 in Atkinson County Missouri.He married ?. He married second to Leanna Bunch Jun 1864 in Burlington Kansas. She was born 31 Dec 1830 in Tennessee, and died 19 Aug
2 CONC  1906 in Atchinson County Missouri.
2 CONT
