2 CONT Rev. William Ratliff Sr. was born on 6 October 1762, in Virginia, British Colonial America,.His likely  father, Reuben Henry Ratliff Sr., was b abt 1730 and his mother, Margaret Frances Hollowell, was b abt 1730.  He married Mary 
2 CONC Margaret Hinson in 1794, in Green, Kentucky. He died on 2 July 1816, in Barren, Kentucky  , and was buried in , at the time,  Center , Barren, Kentucky. Barren was founded 1798. Metcalfe  would be founded 1860, taking some of Barr
2 CONC en. Now, after 1860 , land change distribution,  William's grave site is Metcalfe. 
2 CONT .
2 CONT 1828 court document reference, from August County VA, for Margaret, now Blount, formerly married to William Ratliff, and referring  to Stephen Ratliff, as  handling William's estate.
2 CONT
2 CONT William named a son Jordan (m Lavinia Rowland), b 1810, died 1840 , and Williams son ,  James , named a son Jordan  (m  Nancy Bradley) , b  1821 died 1902. The 1810 Jordan  was Uncle 1821 Jordan.,
