2 CONT Francesco Franceschi (March 2, 1843 – November 27, 1924) – known in Italy by his title and birth name of Cavalier Emanuele Orazio Fenzi – was an Italian banker and horticulturist who spent part of his later career in the United St
2 CONC ates, where his efforts contributed to the introduction of new plant species in southern California.
