2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Louise Marie Charlotte de Bourbon''', Comtesse de Vierzon was born illegitimately on 29 December 1809 at London, EnglandG.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Charles Ferdinand de Bourbon, Duc de Berri and Amy Brown.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Athanae Charles Marin de Charette de la Contrie, Barone de Charette, son of Louis Marin de Charette, Seigneur de La Contrie and Marie Jeanne Louise Loaysel, on 16 June 1827 at Paris, FranceG.1 She died on 26 December 1
2 CONC 891 at age 81 at Château de La Contrie, France.1
2 CONT
2 CONT She was created Comtesse de Vierzon [France] on 10 June 1820, by King Louis XVIII.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Louise Marie Charlotte de Bourbon, Comtesse de Vierzon and Athanae Charles Marin de Charette de la Contrie, Barone de Charette:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Athanase de Charette de la Contrie, Baron de Charette+3 b. 1832, d. 9 Oct 1911
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Granddaughter of President Polk
2 CONT
2 CONT =====================================
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT Illegitimate daughter of the duc du Berry, later acknowledged. Created Comtesse de Vierzon [France] on 10 June 1820, by King Louis XVIII.
2 CONT =====================================
